==Indonesian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|id|liat||colloquial}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|id|ms|lihat}}, from {{inh|id|poz-mly-pro|*lihat}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{id-pr}}

===Verb===
{{head|id|verb|active|melihat|passive|dilihat}}

# {{lb|id|often used with {{l|id|ada}}}} to [[see]] {{gl|to perceive with the eyes}}
#: {{ux|id|Aku '''lihat''' ada anjing berkeliaran di sana.|I '''saw''' a dog roaming around.}}
# to [[see]], to [[know]]
#: {{syn|id|tahu}}
#: {{ux|id|Saya mau '''lihat''' bagaimana kasusnya berkembang.|I want to '''see''' how the case develops.}}
# to [[see]] {{gl|to [[watch]] at a cinema or another media}}
#: {{syn|id|tonton}}
#: {{ux|id|Sudah '''lihat''' film ini belum?|Have you '''seen''' this movie yet?}}
# to [[see]] {{gl|to foresee, predict, or prophesy}}
#: {{syn|id|ramal|tilik}}
# to [[see]], to [[visit]] (a sick person)
#: {{syn|id|jenguk|tengok}}
#: {{ux|id|Nanti kita '''lihat''' dia di rumah sakit.|We'll '''see''' him at the hospital later.}}
# to [[look]] at
#: {{syn|id|pandang}}

