==Malay==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ms|poz-mly-pro|*lihat}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|ms|[li.hat]}}
* {{rhymes|ms|hat|at|s2=2}}
* {{audio|ms|Ms-MY-lihat.ogg|a=Malaysia}}

===Verb===
{{head|ms|verb|Jawi spelling|ليهت|active|melihat|3rd person passive|dilihat}}

# To [[look at]].
#: {{syn|ms|pandang|tengok}}
#: {{ux|ms|Adam sedang '''melihat''' telefonnya sekarang.|Adam is '''looking at''' his phone now.}}
# To [[tell]] the [[future]], to [[prophesy]].
#: {{syn|ms|tilik|ramal|tengok}}
#: {{ux|ms|Adam '''melihat''' nasib kawannya.|Adam '''prophesied''' his friend's future.}}
# To [[perceive]], to [[see]].
#: {{syn|ms|pandang}}
#: {{ux|ms|Adam '''dilihat''' tidak cukup kuat untuk mengangkatnya.|Adam '''was seen''' as being not strong enough to lift that.}}
# To [[visit]].
#: {{syn|ms|lawat|ziarahi|tengok}}
#: {{ux|ms|Adam pergi '''melihat''' neneknya sempena hari raya.|Adam went to '''visit''' his grandma while eid.}}

